  SW --> VIRT[Proxmox Lab Host]
  AP --> MGMT[Management / Infrastructure Zone]
  AP --> TRUST[Trusted Zone]
  AP --> IOT[IoT Zone]
  AP --> CAM[Camera Zone]
  AP --> GUEST[Guest Zone]
  AP --> LAB[Lab Zone]
  AP --> CHILD[Child Zone]
  VIRT --> LAB
  NOTE[Logical architecture; live identifiers and addresses omitted]
